  "body": "Looking for space, flexibility and room for the whole family? This sunny two-storey home on a generous 501sqm (more or less) flat section offers an exceptional combination of comfortable family living, entertaining space\r\n\r\nThoughtfully laid out over two levels, this property is ideal for large or extended families, grandparents wanting their own space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs - Family Comfort & Privacy\r\n* Bright and sunny interiors with 3 generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with an ensuite\r\n* An additional living area, perfect as a family retreat, children's lounge or private space for another family member\r\n\r\nDownstairs - Space to Entertain & More!\r\n* Two separate living areas provide plenty of room to entertain friends and enjoy quality family time\r\n* A self-contained 2-bedroom flat with its own kitchen & living area\r\n* Ideal accommodation for grandparents, extended family to help with mortgage repayments\r\n\r\nEnjoy the peaceful surroundings of Red Beach, with a quiet and relaxed environment for family living.  Conveniently located close to local supermarkets, shops and everyday amenities, with easy access to the motorway for commuting.\r\n\r\nWhether you're accommodating extended family, or simply wanting more room to grow, this property offers flexibility and opportunity that's hard to find.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure this fantastic family home.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit our next open home!",
